'''''The Hound Chases the Fox''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Windswept Wanderlust]].

==Steps==
# Talk to Tingyun
# When you're ready, go talk to Tingyun
# Use Diting to track down Tingyun
# (Optional) Search for clues and find Tingyun
# (Optional) Ask people nearby for any clues to finding Tingyun
# Talk to Tingyun
# Set out for Stargazer Navalia

