===Talk to Tingyun{{subst:void|<!--102050109-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Central Starskiff Haven|update|To make searching operations exponentially easier, Tingyun has introduced a handy tool invented by the Artisanship Commission &mdash; Diting, an ingenium dog used for tracking.<br />With Diting, you have successfully tracked down Tingyun.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Tingyun)
:'''Tingyun:''' You found me~ Diting's quite handy when it comes to tracking, isn't he?
:'''Tingyun:''' If you pick up traces of Kafka in Stargazer Navalia, just switch him on. Don't let her escape.
----
{{Dialogue End}}

===Set out for Stargazer Navalia{{subst:void|<!--102050122-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Central Starskiff Haven|update|All is ready for you to set out for Stargazer Navalia &mdash; a core hub for shipbuilding on the Xianzhou Luofu. There, the secret behind the Stellaron Hunter's invitation for you to come aboard the Xianzhou will be revealed.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

:'''Tingyun:''' Who'd have thought that Stargazer Navalia might become so quiet. "Long were the nights, when the clangor of hammers rose to meet the stars." ...People used to write poems about the shipwrights here.
:'''Tingyun:''' The Luofu relies on the starskiffs produced here to transport people and goods. Now that work in the shipyard has stopped, our internal transport and outbound flights might also grind to a halt.
:'''Tingyun:''' *yawn* Of course, the silver lining is I don't have to go on as many trips anymore.
:'''March 7th:''' You don't seem to worry too much about the Xianzhou, Miss Tingyun.
:'''Tingyun:''' I wouldn't say that &mdash; a good businesswoman doesn't wear her heart on her sleeve. Besides, the alliance has weathered plenty of challenges. We can handle this situation.
:'''Tingyun:''' Just to warn you, if we do run into Kafka, you'll have to do the fighting, benefactors. I'd love to help, but there's very little I can do except cheer you on from the side lines~
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You want to leave all the fun to us?
::'''Tingyun:''' Not a lot of people out there could've fought the mara-struck like you did. I'm only a civil servant &mdash; I can't imagine what Kafka would do to me if I were caught in the fray...
::'''Tingyun:''' We foxians don't live as long as the Xianzhou locals, but I still want to enjoy the hundred-odd years I've got left. You'd do the same in my shoes, wouldn't you?
::But Madam Yukong ordered you to...
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} But Madam Yukong ordered you to...
:'''Tingyun:''' *sigh* Playing the Madam Yukong card, are we? That's not very heroic now, is it.
:'''Tingyun:''' Besides, the Madam Helm Master simply asked me to assist you in navigating around Starskiff Haven. It's no different to any other diplomatic mission or delegate reception.
:{{tx}}
:'''Tingyun:''' Before Diting can start tracking, you'll have to feed him some leads.
:'''Tingyun:''' If Kafka is hiding in Stargazer Navalia, she'll have left behind traces. Let's spread out and look for them &mdash; leave no stone unturned.
{{Dialogue End}}

